Copperjaw is a dwarven man who runs [[Sableclutch Scrap]], a scrapyard in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]]. He is old for a dwarf, with a mashed nose and a black eye that suggest he still settles his business with his hands. He lost his lower jaw at some point and wears a crude slab of copper shaped roughly like one in its place, which is where his name comes from.

He works the yard's crusher himself. He is blunt, quick to test a stranger's grip in a handshake, and untroubled that one of his couriers is a child. [[Anouk Marchal|Anouk]] counts him as a friend and sends work his way.
